      "writtenOn": "2025-01-04T01:12:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the code is slowly moving to call attributionSource to be \"source\" that is lighter on the reader ^^\nBut it would be great if we enforce that this is notNull before using it, as \"data validation\"",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 26,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 43
