      "writtenOn": "2025-01-06T20:05:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only for the next reader.\n\nI don\u0027t want someone seeing a nullpointer and fixing it by adding a null check and gracefully returning. For me requireNonNull is simply enforcing explicitly what is being expected.\n\nI agree that kotlin give that for free 😊",
